<title>USA: ING North American unit buys Vestax.</title>
<headline>ING North American unit buys Vestax.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING North America, a unit of Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV, said Monday that it has bought Vestax Securities Corp, a privately owned broker-dealer.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said Vestax, based in Hudson, Ohio, has 400 representatives throughout the Midwest.</p>
